  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports quality event tracking, deviation investigation, and CAPA effectiveness analysis for a multi-line chemical manufacturer (acids, bases, solvents, polymers, specialty). Quality leadership is accountable to ISO 9001 / responsible-care audit readiness, FDA-grade GMP for pharma-adjacent products, and customer complaints. Cost-of-quality (COQ) for chemicals manufacturers typically runs 5-10% of revenue — making it a primary CFO-visible margin lever.\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Total quality events = COUNT(DISTINCT event_id); track aging and severity mix\n- Critical event count = events with severity = 'Critical'; regulatory reporting threshold\n- Total cost of quality = SUM(cost_of_quality_usd); industry benchmark 5-10% of revenue\n- Average resolution days = AVG(resolution_days); target ≤ 30 days for major, ≤ 60 for critical\n- CAPA closure rate = closed_effective_count / total_quality_events; target ≥ 90%\n- Batch pass rate (first-pass yield) = AVG(batch_pass_rate_pct); target ≥ 95% on-spec\n- Open event count = events in 'Open' or 'In Progress'; backlog health\n- Temperature deviation = ABS(temperature_deviation_c); >3°C signals process instability\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - quality_events_metrics (source: quality_events) — dims: event_date, product_category, production_line, event_type, severity, root_cause_category; measures: total_quality_events, critical_event_count, total_cost_of_quality_usd, avg_resolution_days, closed_effective_count, open_event_count, unique_product_count, max_cost_of_quality.\n  - quality_kpi_monthly_metrics (source: quality_kpi_monthly) — dims: report_month, product_category, product_id; measures: total_monthly_events, total_critical_events, avg_capa_closure_rate, total_monthly_coq_usd, avg_batch_pass_rate, total_avg_resolution_days, max_total_events.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. product_name, batch_id, yield_pct, purity_pct, temperature_deviation_c, capa_status).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show monthly total cost of quality by product category for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Top 10 products by cost of quality this year — and what is the dominant root cause?",
    "How has critical event count trended month-over-month across production lines?",
    "Which root cause categories have the highest open / in-progress event backlog?",
    "What is the average CAPA closure rate by product category over the last 6 months?",
    "Top 10 production lines by total quality events — and how do their batch pass rates compare?",
    "Which products have a batch pass rate below 90%, and what is the COQ dollar exposure?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in open event count?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT event_date, MEASURE(open_event_count) AS open_event_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_events_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY event_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How many distinct transactions appeared each month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', event_date) AS month, COUNT(DISTINCT transaction) AS distinct_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_events",
        "GROUP BY 1",
        "ORDER BY 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total critical events per month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT report_month, MEASURE(total_critical_events) AS total_critical_events",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_kpi_monthly_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY report_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Which chemical products have the highest total *?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT product_name, SUM(*) AS record_count, SUM(cost_of_quality_usd) AS total_cost_of_quality_usd",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_events",
        "WHERE capa_status = 'Open'",
        "GROUP BY product_name",
        "ORDER BY total_cost_of_quality_usd DESC",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total batch size in kilograms over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT batch_date, SUM(batch_size_kg) AS total_batch_size_kg",
        "FROM {fqn}.batch_records",
        "GROUP BY batch_date ORDER BY batch_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average capa closure rate for the month changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT report_month, AVG(capa_closure_rate_pct) AS avg_capa_closure_rate_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY report_month ORDER BY report_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has open event count changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT event_date, MEASURE(open_event_count) AS open_event_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_events_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY event_date"
      ]
    }
  ],
